Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This video is brought
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to you by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.43,0:01:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,R. I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.30,0:02:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fortuitous occasion indeed,\Njust who I wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're angry with me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently you're unhappy that\NI forced you to kill Nicholas D.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your scene is over now, Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the curtain will\Nrise for the final act.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to live without\Nbeing able to pay off a debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Animals run instinctively\Nwhen they sense danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your behavior is\Ncompletely irrational.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sacrifice is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even deserve\Nto be called a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.80,0:03:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason the human\Nrace came to possess
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the capability of\Ncompassion and a sense of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,moral was because they\Nsomehow mistakenly believed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,themselves to be a\Nsuperior breed of beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment they taste the fear of\Nknowing there's a superior breed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something seems to take\Ncontrol over them every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for some reason, humans act\Nmerely by instinct from that point on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cornered mouse attacks the cat,\Neven knowing the cat has the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the cat was wise to the mouse's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mouse seeks death in\Norder to avoid the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine the place between life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the pain you feel\Nis your very essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The essence of the human\Nanimal known as homo sapien.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH\NGarbage,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only good for consuming resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, Vash the Stampede will\Nexperience eternal pain and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$5,000! $5,000! Get down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$5,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$5,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$5,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$5,000! $5,000! Hey, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, miss, may I have some donuts, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$30 double dollars worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and could you please\Nmake them fresh ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want any day olds, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, yeah, whatever, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A populated city at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.54,0:05:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure feels good to see\Nhappy people around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lucky, lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonjour, je t'aime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.77,0:05:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That smells great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a heavenly aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smells like little cakes made from honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And without further ado...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so good to be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gonna buy us some new toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been to Maggie's store?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has new bolts of that\Nnice fabric you like so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which girl is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, I'll go tell her myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least tell me for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes three days to get there\Nby sand steaming. Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you've got absolutely\Nnothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what, I'm\Ngonna get you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why are these so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do all these terrible things always\Nhave to happen whenever you're around?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of me that friends die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all got involved because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but that's why\Nyou can't stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you an important question,\Nand I expect a decent answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, for once, I need\Nyou to be honest with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he lives, I\Ncould never die honorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as Knives is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's Knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother, I'm sorry to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well that's it, now I need to spend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spend a little time alone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, there's a girl in pain who\Ncould really use your support right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, don't you want to follow him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I'm glad that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No good troublemaker is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's get the report in quick\Nand get them to take us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this detail once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so many better things out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we don't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have enough lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can handle it, Meryl. But you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.36,0:09:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless we go after him now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a good possibility that we may\Nnever see him again in this lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with you, Meryl? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm completely, totally,\Nperfectly fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I need to get up and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, as we both know, if\Nwe don't work, we don't get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea which way he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be ready in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather all of your things\Ntogether, too, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't leave a thing behind\Nbecause we won't have time to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he's a grown-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone feels like crying sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend of mine went away,\Nand I'm sad. Why? Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died because of you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.34,0:10:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who\Nkilled Wolf, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you hadn't swayed him with your\Nstupid ideas, he might have had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that's true,\Nhe didn't have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided to do this as my humble way of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exhibiting grief for the\Nloss of a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd I do, you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you are you going to draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop don't do it someone else will\Ndie if you do this another one will die
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. You can't possibly draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to think you've\Nnever killed anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid you're very sadly\Nmistaken You've managed to fool no one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to believe\Nthat because your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't dirty because you didn't personally
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pull the trigger that\Nyou are innocent when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in actuality you've\Nkilled countless people,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including the gung-ho guns and\Nyour friend, Nicholas D. Wolfwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was forced to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time you make\Nthat face, it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My left arm begins to\Nshake uncontrollably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it happens to be the very arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that attached your arm to your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be waiting for you on that hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish to shoot me now, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head feels funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you be so damn casual\Nto toy with people's lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You alone turned July\Nand Augusta to rubble
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and put a huge hole in\Nthe fifth moon as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can deny it, but you're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and he are exactly the same breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Thou Gung-Ho Gun,\NMid-Valley the Horn Freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who plays the greatest\Nmusic on the greatest stage of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Join me on a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you, Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede? Oh,\Nno. No way. It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HELLO!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ORCHESTRAL SAVE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow he's able to\Nsynchronize the sound waves
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from his horn with the\Nphysical sensation of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Sylvia is responding\Nrather well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you wouldn't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but up close,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sound that's produced\Nby even a famous top-quality
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instrument can actually\Nsound rather flat sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, there are varying degrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you are the only one able\Nto bring out the greatest sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beautiful melody is\Ngreeted with applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The audience shouts with appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The acknowledgement of\Na splendid performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you finish me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious you could\Nhave taken me out by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm under his orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The choice is not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't defy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone working for Knives\Nis at his beck and call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You relinquish all\Nrights and free thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A superior being trying to show mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.15,0:14:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jesus, Vash, don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help! Stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I need to spend a\Nlittle time alone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't start brooding, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a waste of time and energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, you'll regret\Nit later, so just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, you're right,\Nyou're absolutely right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to lose my nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep going, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, drink some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about iron will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dedication is commendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The show must go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My B-flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My B-flat's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, the show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been trying for\Na ricochet shot? Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but it's not quite\Ntime for the curtain call yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to accept this as my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The destiny of the dying. Don't! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you shoot now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have died a very\Nlong time ago, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The instant we fell upon this sandy\Nland without pain and without sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the schedule has merely been set back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.24,0:17:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is time to embrace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.31,0:18:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the climax, Vash the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, I wouldn't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many sad things happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether they are friend or\Nenemy, the people you meet die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's enough to sap one's tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know this is not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really expect the\Nend to come so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand you're not human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is time to realize exactly who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.68,0:18:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is power in that light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power that you have always possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even more, this represents what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NOT AGAIN!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you given up yet, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really quite annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight back or you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would welcome this to be my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.43,0:19:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no reason for such\Nan egocentric and complete
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life like mine to be\Nallowed to continue anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the gift of nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My master is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's looking forward to your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was compelled to attach\Nthis arm to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.42,0:20:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to because you\Nrefused to be by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.34,0:20:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright. Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.00,0:20:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you need do is pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you have killed me,\Nthis will all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have free will. Stop\Nit... Don't make me shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your faith is hopelessly obstinate\Nto actually believe the prattlings
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of a woman who speaks in idealistic\Nterms that are worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that kind of\Nthinking is reasonable
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for someone who's lived\Nfor more than a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.72,0:21:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that way of life is\Npathetic and comical.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.62,0:21:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem savor A wasted existence who\Nonly spoke in aggravating logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A worthless human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like me, but unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luck and persistence won't work forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we journey through our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we must always search for\Nways to make everyone happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.86,0:21:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't force your way of life upon others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has the right to\Ntake the life of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me your dreams\Nin a world like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:22:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep your vision clear,\Nyou will always find the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, bash the Stampede, you will\Nexperience eternal pain and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:23:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:23:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.98,0:24:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was dreaming, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything was so horribly dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.14,0:24:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There on that planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.94,0:24:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even people's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watched the people who\Nlived there from far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept wondering why they went on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How they kept on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.68,0:24:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.14,0:24:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.32,0:24:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what should I do?

